What's new: 

Main changes

- Update to Technical Base$
- Ability to change cars in multiplayer and training modes;
- New car: Nimble;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/29414514/a9d4a564ce47e20a867126de4e0b48b0f61e3c5a.png

