Extended list of adjustments: 

Cars

- Various car visuals fixes;
- Horizon GT4 camera seats focus fix;
- Kaiju camera taillights focus fix;

Garage

- Selector missing on the last chosen car issue fix; 

Dynostand

- Wheelbase moving after setup change for custom bodykits issue fix; 
- The display of the turbine pressure value has been changed to show hundredths

Livery Editor

- Fixed the automatic application of projection when moving a sticker;

Singleplayer

- The issue with the minimap not appearing after leaving the config selection window in "Tandem Drift" mode has been fixed;

Multiplayer

- Alphabetical sorting of the friends list in the invitation window to the room has been added;
- Indicator for rooms with disabled driver aids added;
- Waiting for players' cars to load before starting the competition added;
- Fixed incorrect collision status update after respawn;
- Fixed camera settings reset after exiting spectator mode;
- Fixed incorrect respawn point after competition;
- The wording of the context menu options in the room with the minimap disabled has been fixed;
- Fixed narrow finish zone on some Springstone track configurations;
- Fixed penalty for 'Drift in the wrong direction' on Kami Road Clipping B configuration;

Top-32

- Fixed UI overlap when connecting to a network race from a replay;

Workshop

- Fixed resetting of 'Rear Wheel Drive' and 'Load' filters in the workshop modifications after restarting the game;

Controls

- Added steering wheel rotation angle animation setting for all control schemes;
- Fixed applying a different control scheme after resetting additional settings;

Graphics

- Fixed black screen issue with certain custom body kits;
- Fixed incorrect reflections after exiting photo mode on some custom tracks;

Gameplay

- Fixed car shaking in drone camera with autofocus off;
- Fixed kilometers driven not displaying in player profile;
- Fixed inability to control free camera using keyboard with 'Wheel' control scheme;

Optimization

- Optimized car loading in multiplayer;
- Optimization of the Workshop Tracks section;
- Fixed FPS drops when rewinding replays;

Have fun!

